# BARS — optional local overrides.
#
# Copy this file to .env.local only if you use another Supabase project.
# Vite loads .env.local automatically. Without it, the defaults from
# src/core/config.js are used.
#
# The publishable key is safe to ship to browsers: it maps to the `anon` role
# and every table is protected by RLS. NEVER put a service-role key or a
# database password in this file, in the repository, or in the client bundle.

